# This is a committed *source* fixture (base case + split boundary STLs), not an
# OpenFOAM run directory. Tests copy it into a tmp_path before meshing/solving, so
# nothing here should ever produce output — but guard against a stray in-place run
# leaving mesh/solver artifacts that then get committed. Keep only 0/ (initial
# fields); ignore generated time directories, the built mesh, logs and .foam files.
[1-9]*/
0.[0-9]*/
constant/polyMesh/
processor*/
postProcessing/
log.*
*.foam
